* 13-opamp-generic.lib - behavioural voltage-feedback op-amp macromodel
* SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
* Written for the Omnia P0.3 spike. Generic parameters, no vendor data.
* Terminal order: non-inverting input, inverting input, positive supply,
* negative supply, output.
.subckt OPAMP_GENERIC inp inn vcc vee out
+ PARAMS: AOL=200k GBW=1Meg ROUT=75 VSAT=1.5
* input stage and dominant pole
RIN inp inn 10Meg
EGAIN g 0 inp inn {AOL}
RP g p {AOL/(6.2832*GBW)}
CP p 0 1
* output stage with rail clamps
XOUT p out vcc vee OUTSTAGE PARAMS: ROUT={ROUT} VSAT={VSAT}
.subckt OUTSTAGE in out vp vn PARAMS: ROUT=75 VSAT=1.5
EBUF b 0 in 0 1
RO b out {ROUT}
DHI out h DCLAMP
VHI vp h {VSAT}
DLO l out DCLAMP
VLO l vn {VSAT}
.model DCLAMP D(IS=1e-15 N=0.1)
.ends OUTSTAGE
.ends OPAMP_GENERIC
